 {:status :passed
  :requirement
  "Public snapshot constructors admit only database values whose committedness the source can witness. Ordinary and as-of values from the acl's own source are admitted; filtered, since, history, and speculative (d/with, db-with) values are refused with :eacl/unsupported-database-value before any basis identity, cache entry, or proof frame exists."
